@mi-lu-uncle/dsh-session-delete README · @mi-lu-uncle/dsh-session-delete：English | [简体中文](README.zh-CN.md) | [日本語](README.ja.md)

Adds a **Delete session** action to the session "…" menu of DeepSeek Harness (DSH).

DSH `0.2.0-rc.2` only ships **archive** (a soft delete: hidden, but all data is kept). This plugin fills the gap — one click **permanently deletes** a session together with its on-disk data.

@mi-lu-uncle/dsh-session-delete README · Safety：- **Running sessions refuse deletion**: it uses the same `workspace/session-activity` detection as DSH's archive. Only genuinely running work (an in-flight conversation turn, background jobs, …) is blocked with "this session is running"; idle old sessions (even if still kept alive in DSH's memory) delete normally.
- Deletion goes through DSH's own workspace-registry write paths (`detachSession` / `unarchiveSession` / `unpinSession`), so persisted state stays consistent.
- Routes are same-origin fenced; only requests coming from the DSH UI itself are accepted.

@mi-lu-uncle/dsh-session-delete README · Install：This plugin targets DSH `0.2.0-rc.2` and newer `0.2.x` releases (currently verified on `0.2.1-rc.2`), and is linked into the `desktop` profile as a local directory:

```sh
dsh plugin --profile desktop add "link:/absolute/path/dsh-session-delete"
```

Then **restart DSH** for it to take effect.

You can also edit `~/.dsh/profiles/desktop/package.json` manually:

```jsonc
{
  "dependencies": {
    "@mi-lu-uncle/dsh-session-delete": "link:/absolute/path/dsh-session-delete"
  },

@mi-lu-uncle/dsh-session-delete README · Limitations / notes：- This is a community plugin built on DSH's public extension points (the session-menu slot `sidebar.workspaces.session.menu.item` plus host-side file/registry cleanup). If a future DSH release ships an official "delete session" API, prefer that.
- Running sessions refuse deletion; if you really need one gone, stop it first (finish/archive its work) and then delete.
- The full-text search index is a rebuildable read model of DSH's; right after a delete there may be briefly stale results until the next rebuild.

@mi-lu-uncle/dsh-session-delete README · @mi-lu-uncle/dsh-session-delete：[English](README.md) | 简体中文 | [日本語](README.ja.md)

给 DeepSeek Harness（DSH）的会话「…」菜单加一个**「删除会话」**入口。

DSH 0.2.0-rc.2 只提供了**归档**（软删除：隐藏但保留全部数据），没有真正的删除。本插件补上这个缺失的入口——点一下即可**永久删除**一个会话及其磁盘数据。

@mi-lu-uncle/dsh-session-delete README · 安全：- **正在运行的会话拒绝删除**：用 DSH 归档同款的 `workspace/session-activity` 检测，只有真正在跑的工作（进行中的对话 turn、后台任务等）会被拦下并提示「该会话正在运行中」；已经闲下来的旧会话（哪怕仍被 DSH 保活在内存里）可以正常删除。
- 删除操作走 DSH 自己的工作区注册表写入路径（`detachSession` / `unarchiveSession` / `unpinSession`），保证持久化状态一致。
- 路由做了同源校验，仅接受来自 DSH 界面自身的请求。

@mi-lu-uncle/dsh-session-delete README · 安装：本插件面向 DSH `0.2.0-rc.2` 及更新的 `0.2.x`（当前在 `0.2.1-rc.2` 上验证），以本地目录方式链接进 `desktop` profile：

```sh
dsh plugin --profile desktop add "link:/绝对路径/dsh-session-delete"
```

然后**重启 DSH** 使其生效。

也可以手动改 `~/.dsh/profiles/desktop/package.json`：

```jsonc
{
  "dependencies": {
    "@mi-lu-uncle/dsh-session-delete": "link:/绝对路径/dsh-session-delete"
  },

之后在 profile 目录执行 `pnpm install`，再重启 DSH。

@mi-lu-uncle/dsh-session-delete README · 局限 / 说明：- 这是社区插件，利用了 DSH 的公开扩展点（会话菜单槽 `sidebar.workspaces.session.menu.item` + 宿主端文件/注册表清理）。若 DSH 后续版本提供官方的「删除会话」接口，建议改用官方能力。
- 正在运行的会话被拒绝删除；如确需删除，请先停止该会话（结束/归档其工作）再删。
- 全文搜索索引是 DSH 的「可重建读模型」，删除后可能有极短暂的陈旧结果，下次重建即恢复。
